["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Who Feeds the GPUs? Inside AI&#x27;s Hidden $30B Layer | Renen Hallak, VAST Data DASE KV cache DataEnclave neocloud NVMe over Fabrics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-madpod-ai-工厂的中间层-模型正在变成一种需要管理的资源/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/90800bca4b008abf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">MAD Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 工厂的中间层：模型正在变成一种需要管理的资源</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">五层蛋糕里最不起眼的一层，正在决定谁能把 AI 卖给受监管的大企业——因为模型权重和企业数据，两边都不想让对方看见。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">存储</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Re-Founding Incumbents for the AI Era with Sequence Holdings Co-Founder and CEO Michael Lee perpetual holding company human assembly line organizational physics Atlas lattice Applied Epic\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-nopriors-ai-改造存量公司-比投初创更赚钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ef131747a07ad549-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">42:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 改造存量公司，比投初创更赚钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 对经济的影响是不均匀的：餐厅和高尔夫球场不受影响，但拥有品牌、牌照和网络效应的存量龙头，一旦被工程化改造，就能变成市场领导者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 落地</span><span class=\"tag\">私募股权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Wealthy People Are Hiding in Plain Sight (ft. Owen Zidar) | #428 pass-through firm non-compete search fund stealth consolidation W-2\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-rationalreminder-美国真正的富人靠拥有企业致富-不是靠工资-也不在华尔街/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>美国真正的富人靠拥有企业致富，不是靠工资，也不在华尔街</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1960到2022年间，美国收入最高的0.1%人群中，企业主经营性收入占比从17%涨到43%，反超工资——真正的财富积累发生在不起眼的本地生意里，不是硅谷或华尔街。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富分布</span><span class=\"tag\">企业主</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"I have some questions for Mark Zuckerberg aggregation theory App Tracking Transparency prisoner&#x27;s dilemma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-decoder-扎克伯格的双标-青少年安全要监管-ai-安全靠市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5195c7fc5677006c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">23:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>扎克伯格的双标：青少年安全要监管，AI 安全靠市场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Meta 在青少年安全上主张政府统一监管，在 AI 安全上却坚持市场自会解决——同一套囚徒困境，他站了两边。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Meta</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How to build a billion-dollar sports team from scratch, with Golden State Valkyries’ Jess Smith expansion draft influence council blitz scaling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-masterscale-wnba-新军两年估值翻二十倍-靠的不是球星/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db5b5ed43f5c7c76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">37:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters of Scale</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>WNBA 新军两年估值翻二十倍，靠的不是球星</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">金州女武神从 5000 万美元扩军费做到十亿美元估值，靠的是先定义品牌再进市场、把九家创始伙伴拉进同一张桌子，以及把票务只当成生意的一小块。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">体育商业</span><span class=\"tag\">品牌建设</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"From AGENTS.md to Enterprise Deployment Agents.md buildpack MCP gateway air gap 12 factor application\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-practicalai-企业里跑-ai-智能体-先解决它半夜会不会掉线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5fdd0bb6d017658d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">48:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Practical AI</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>企业里跑 AI 智能体，先解决它半夜会不会掉线</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">企业智能体不是新物种，是又一个要过合规、要审计、要能被平台统一托管的 app；真正的难点是状态、身份和网络位置。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业部署</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Stress: The Science of Chilling Out vagus nerve cortisol threat response challenge response vagus nerve stimulator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-sciencevs-从没受过什么苦的人-心理健康反而比吃过苦的人差/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">40:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>从没受过什么苦的人，心理健康反而比吃过苦的人差</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">布法罗大学的研究发现，一辈子零逆境的人心理健康得分比经历过一些逆境的人更差——压力反应本身需要被练出来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">压力管理</span><span class=\"tag\">皮质醇</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Is Upending the Lives of People Who Do Social Media Professionally carousel reel slop BTS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-oddlots-ai-时代做社媒-老板比算法更让人绝望/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">27:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代做社媒，老板比算法更让人绝望</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">营销团队真正的 AI 冲击来自老板：把直觉外包给 Claude，只批 Copilot 生成的方案，员工只好把想法伪装成 Copilot 界面骗过审批。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创作者经济</span><span class=\"tag\">社媒营销</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Advice Line with Danny Meyer of Shake Shack expected behaviors day one mentality RTD Goldbelly GLP-1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-howibuilt-餐厅老板给三个食品创业者的建议-比融资课有用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aedd4aae43a50f3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">41:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>餐厅老板给三个食品创业者的建议，比融资课有用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Danny Meyer 判断品牌的标准不是产品好不好，而是顾客见不到你时还能不能感到被照顾——这决定了他给三个消费品牌的建议方向。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">餐饮</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Case Against an AI Pause | Eddy Lazzarin P-abundance P-doom agent swarm agent fleets mech interpretability script kitties\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-a16z-ai-暂停论站不住脚-我们该算的是延迟的代价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 暂停论站不住脚：我们该算的是延迟的代价</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把 AI 事故当成网络安全和控制失败，而不是超级智能的预兆；真正被忽略的不是末日概率，而是延迟进步让人类放弃的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How to Invest for A Hundred Years | Inigo Fraser Jenkins total portfolio approach rule against perpetuities recency bias 60-40\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-hiddenforces-股票和债券的风险其实一样大-只是没人告诉你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b4203c8f6331570-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">52:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Forces</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>股票和债券的风险其实一样大，只是没人告诉你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把持有期拉长到20年，股票和债券的波动率几乎相等，债券出现实际亏损的概率反而更高——所以长期投资者真正该盯的不是市场基准，是购买力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">资产配置</span><span class=\"tag\">长期投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Democratic Socialism. Hope or Hopeless? DSA Rerum Novarum War on Poverty realignment left wing of the possible\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-throughline-美国-社会主义教父-的选择-向民主党内部妥协-而非揭竿另立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>美国「社会主义教父」的选择：向民主党内部妥协，而非揭竿另立</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Harrington押注：与其在体制外另立社会主义政党，不如挤进民主党内部改造它——哪怕这意味着1968年要为支持越战的候选人站台。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">民主党</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Energy From Orbit: Can We Trust Power Beamed From Space? - Martin Soltau, Space Solar (EP 42) firm power rectenna power beaming intermittency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-theinbetweente-把发电站搬到太空-电价能降一个数量级吗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1b62c3494802d4ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The In-Between Tech and Trust Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>把发电站搬到太空，电价能降一个数量级吗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">太空太阳能不是科幻：同样的光伏板在轨道上发电量是地面的 8 到 13 倍，真正的瓶颈不是物理，而是监管和公众信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太空太阳能</span><span class=\"tag\">能源转型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"277.从提醒你，到替你办：Today想把Personal AI带到哪一步？ Personal Agent harness proactive KVCache rubrics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-luanfanshu-个人-agent-的胜负手不是模型-是记忆和主动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bbe378ca5d7d3313-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"乱\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">乱翻书</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>个人 Agent 的胜负手不是模型，是记忆和主动</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Today 团队认为模型已接近 AGI、成本每年降十倍，瓶颈转移到记忆与主动性；而主动做不好的产品，只会变成又一个骚扰推送。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Personal Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">记忆系统</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Maya Hieroglyphs Decoded Classic Mayan uhul ahau Ahpitz\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-ancients-玛雅数学家的公式写在王宫旁的墙上-只给自己看/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/863dd630b8114639-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>玛雅数学家的公式写在王宫旁的墙上，只给自己看</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2010年危地马拉舒尔顿意外发掘出一间小屋，墙上写满历法计算公式并署名萨克坦瓦什——这不是刻给公众看的纪念碑文，而是一位玛雅数学家留给自己查阅的私人笔记。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">玛雅</span><span class=\"tag\">古文字破译</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"1M Users in 3 Months, Pivoted, Then Tripled User Count | James Clift, Durable GEO GMV South Park Commons vibe coding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-solofounders-ai-让开公司比找工作容易-但单人创始人没有退路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3187025de0dd83a2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 让开公司比找工作容易，但单人创始人没有退路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Durable 三个月做到一百万用户，创始人却说自己绕了弯路：网站生成不是终局，把服务业的全部后台交给 AI 才是。单人创始人不是更自由，是把所有决定都压在自己身上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">单人创始人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The &#x27;Scandalous&#x27; Life of Marie Antoinette Petit Hameau Salic law Estates General flight to Varennes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-historyhit-法国国王没有情妇-于是所有的恨都砸向王后/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8da68a5c17656ef9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">53:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>法国国王没有情妇，于是所有的恨都砸向王后</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">君主是神选的，攻击国王等于叛国，能骂的只有王后和情妇。路易十六偏偏不像历代法王那样有情妇，怨恨没有分流口，全落在玛丽·安托瓦内特一个人身上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法国大革命</span><span class=\"tag\">王权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Luca Ferrari, Bending Spoons CEO: The $40K Origin Story, Buying Product-Market Fit &amp; Why Private Equity Can&#x27;t Compete TLB (Term Loan B) unlevered returns\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-allin-私募股权学不会这套打法-团队和技术焊死后就没法转卖/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/699f18b66a57c00f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>私募股权学不会这套打法：团队和技术焊死后就没法转卖</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创始人光环不是必需品：Bending Spoons靠统一技术底座和小团队把收购来的产品跑到10分，这套打法PE学不来，因为PE要把公司分开养肥了卖，不敢把团队和技术打通。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">并购</span><span class=\"tag\">私募股权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.276 做月嫂育儿嫂的姐姐，都有故事 chemistry 飞单 预约单和急单 儿童成长陪伴师\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-bizthisway-好阿姨永远在户上-家政顾问卖的不是信息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商业就是这样</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>好阿姨永远在户上，家政顾问卖的不是信息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">家政是供给主导的行业，好阿姨不流入市场，顾问真正难的不是签单而是售后换人；雇主和阿姨都是工资的搬运工。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">家政</span><span class=\"tag\">月嫂育儿嫂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"E911.万人工厂消失后，他的 200 万张照片成了时代档案 卖猪仔 自我民族志 马格兰 Off-Pix\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-cn907a40-万人工厂消失后-他用-20-年拍下打工者的日常/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec61bd9ea105317f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"故\"><span class=\"dur\">43:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">故事FM</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>万人工厂消失后，他用 20 年拍下打工者的日常</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">别人拍时代的异常，他偏拍时代的日常——吃饭、打卡、学英语。等万人大厂真的消失，只有极少数人留下了这套档案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">制造业</span><span class=\"tag\">纪实摄影</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"VCs Would Bet on Open-Source AI Over OpenAI and Anthropic | E2341 Unreasonable Hospitality Dream Weaver table stakes minute of grace\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-twist-把服务当成本中心的公司-正在把护城河让出去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/94d63a8348494027-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>把服务当成本中心的公司，正在把护城河让出去</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">产品会被更好的产品取代，品牌会被更强的品牌取代，唯一长期存在的竞争优势是待客之道——持续而慷慨地投资于关系。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">待客之道</span><span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"An Exclusive Interview With Ukraine’s President Zelensky PAC-2 PAC-3 Shahed drones\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-wsjournal-泽连斯基-中东战争正在抽走乌克兰的防空导弹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>泽连斯基：中东战争正在抽走乌克兰的防空导弹</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国每月只造 60 到 65 枚导弹，中东开战第一天就打掉 803 枚。泽连斯基说，普京要的就是一场长战争，因为资源耗尽对乌克兰不利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄乌战争</span><span class=\"tag\">中东局势</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Who Is Wealthy in America, and How Did They Get Rich? pass-through business Survey of Consumer Finances C corporation TCJA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-mastersinbiz-美国最富的一群人-不是ceo而是开洗车店和暖通公司的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3553c0305688ae6b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">25:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>美国最富的一群人，不是CEO而是开洗车店和暖通公司的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国300万私人企业主净资产超500万美元，合计财富是福布斯400富豪的十倍以上——他们开洗车店、暖通公司、汽车经销店，靠的是拥有而不是挣工资。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富分布</span><span class=\"tag\">创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How Deep Learning Finally Cracked Messy Tables - Frank Hutter in-context learning posterior predictive distribution do-calculus structural causal model ELO score\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-mlst-深度学习靠合成数据训练-终于打赢了表格数据里的xgboost/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/166bfadd1a24fa05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ML Street Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>深度学习靠合成数据训练，终于打赢了表格数据里的XGBoost</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">能找到的真实表格数据集只有约5万个，不足以喂饱深度网络；PriorLabs转而用因果结构模型批量合成训练数据，让TabPFN第一次在表格预测上稳定超过XGBoost和CatBoost。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">表格数据</span><span class=\"tag\">基础模型</span>\n</div></div></a>"]